      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:06.272283Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Buses** (`struct bus_type`) — communication channel (PCI, USB, I2C, platform)",
